{"id":"6493b2eeaa7f968f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-adapted.md","title":"Adapted Process","display":"df-adapted — Adapted Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adapted","aliases":["58-df-adapted","Adapted Process"],"display":"df-adapted — Adapted Process","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adapted"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adapted</span><span>Adapted Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adapted — Adapted Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in V\">\\(\\Omega\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(X,F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (实值可测函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adapted}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Adapted}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adapted}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Adapted}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (typed predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq F_\\bullet(t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(\\Omega,F_\\bullet(t),X(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq F_\\bullet(t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(\\Omega,F_\\bullet(t),X(t)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adapted}(X,F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\Omega\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adapted}(X,F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\Omega\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The typed predicate exposes the time set and sample space. The binary projection is retained for existing downstream notation and binds both formerly hidden parameters existentially.</li>\n<li>A process is adapted if at each time <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>, the random variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_t\">\\(X_t\\)</span> is measurable with respect to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_t\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_t\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_t\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_t\\)</span> represents the information available up to time <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n<li>Predictable: measurable with respect to the sigma-algebra generated by left-continuous processes</li>\n<li>Progressive: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,\\omega) \\mapsto X_s(\\omega)\">\\((s,\\omega) \\mapsto X_s(\\omega)\\)</span> is measurable for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\leq t\">\\(s \\leq t\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (实值可测函数谓词, see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X,F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adapted}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adapted}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}typed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nI\\subseteq\\mathbb R_+\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F_\\bullet,I,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(F_\\bullet(t),\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in I\\;\\bigl(s\\leq t\\to F_\\bullet(s)\\subseteq F_\\bullet(t)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(\\Omega,F_\\bullet(t),X(t)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adapted\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Adapted}(X,F_\\bullet)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,\\Omega\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Adapted}_S(X,F_\\bullet,I,\\Omega)","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"X_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_t","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"(s,\\omega) \\mapsto X_s(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"s \\leq t","display":false}],"bytes":2253,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0bca8961c66270c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":